{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Plantempo 是一款專為日常園藝愛好者設計的植物護理日誌應用，它能根據當地天氣與濕度自動調整澆水提醒。這款 App 完全免費且無訂閱制，無需建立帳戶即可使用，讓您在享受綠色生活的同時，也能輕鬆管理家中的花草，避免過度澆水或遺漏照顧。</p>\n\n<h2>精準氣候感測與隱私記錄</h2>\n<p>該應用具備智能氣候感測功能，能依據熱浪或涼爽週氣溫變化動態調整每株植物的澆水時間，確保土壤適時休息。每日僅發送一次準時提醒，完成後自動排程下一次任務。此外，它提供離線運作的私密圖文日誌，支援 iCloud 同步但不需註冊帳戶，讓您安心記錄植物成長點滴，並透過房間分組與隔離區管理，讓整體庭園井然有序。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-70-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-71-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-72-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-73-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-74-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-75-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Plantempo: Plant Care Journal</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T01:04:50.056221+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":347,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}